notes.notes:
Fixes: 


 Fixed some Popup problems;
 Fixed optimization settings;
 Fixed item durability;
 Some other fixes;

Added: 

 Add new recipes for furnance. Now you can make iron and gold ingot in furnance;
 Texture changes for ores and drops.

A lot of updates, fixes, and some interesting features!
Fixes:

 Fixed stacks of items, now it stacks correctly;
 Fixed some mistakes while trying to replace campfire;
 Some little fixes

Added:

 Added light on spawnpoint;
 Now you can destroy woods, stones and bushes at the spawnpoint
 Added new recipe for cloth. Now you need to get wool from sheeps, then use spindle to craft textile.

In this update we have changed: 

 Fixed a bug that prevented old Steam users from connecting to the server;
 Fixed a bug that did not allow exiting the tent correctly;
 Fixed chat (chat range and text doubling);
 Fixed a bug with entering buildings;
 Added a "Teleport To spawn" button in case you get stuck
 Changed the Community button in the main menu on Wiki. Now you can read information about what is in the game.
